{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50861","headline":"省题诗二十一首 咏菊 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 咏菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来多野菊，节应[有]黄花。\n闲叶玉如栗，满藂金出沙。\n池边迷瑞鹄，洞里悟仙牙。\n蘂散非红豓，香飘异[绮]葩。\n赠诗宜魏帝，泛酒称陶家。\n明日登高处，期君手不赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}